{'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I appreciate your interest in my perspective on housing affordability. In my view, local government should take a multifaceted approach to address this issue. This could include increasing the availability of affordable housing units through incentives for developers, implementing rent control measures to protect tenants, and providing more support for first-time homebuyers with down payment assistance programs.

