{'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I understand that housing affordability is a significant concern for many people. In my view, local government could take several steps to address this issue. For instance, they could work on increasing the supply of affordable housing by incentivizing developers to build more low-cost units. They could also consider implementing or expanding rent control measures to protect tenants from sudden and steep rent increases.

